   Bitcoin Hub UI skeleton - Settings tab (spec 6.1 row Settings; keep list K19-K23).
   Hub power is a read-only mirror pointing at the header switch (R-BTCUI-5). Change PIN, the terminal
   link toggle and Clear notifications are inert. The recipe line uses the new tab names.
